        ("$\\sin 75^\\circ$ এর সঠিক ত্রিকোণমিতিক মান কোনটি?", ["\\frac{\\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{2}}{4}", "\\frac{\\sqrt{6} - \\sqrt{2}}{4}", "\\frac{\\sqrt{3} + 1}{2}", "\\frac{\\sqrt{2} + 1}{2}"], "A", "$\\sin 75^\\circ = \\sin(45^\\circ + 30^\\circ) = \\sin 45^\\circ \\cos 30^\\circ + \\cos 45^\\circ \\sin 30^\\circ = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}$।", "ত্রিকোণমিতি", "BUET Admission 2016-17", "EASY"),
