        ("$A = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 4 \\end{pmatrix}$ হলে $A^{-1}$ ম্যাট্রিক্সটি কোনটি?", ["\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{pmatrix} 4 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{pmatrix}", "\\begin{pmatrix} 4 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{pmatrix}", "\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 4 \\end{pmatrix}", "\\frac{1}{11}\\begin{pmatrix} 4 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{pmatrix}"], "A", "$\\det(A) = (2)(4) - (3)(1) = 8 - 3 = 5$। বিপরীত ম্যাট্রিক্স $A^{-1} = \\frac{1}{\\det(A)} \\text{adj}(A) = \\frac{1}{5} \\begin{pmatrix} 4 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{pmatrix}$।", "ম্যাট্রিক্স", "BUET Admission 2021-22", "EASY"),
        ("$\\int_0^1 x e^x dx$ এর মান কত?", ["1", "e - 1", "e", "2"], "A", "আংশিক যৌগজীকরণ ($u=x, dv=e^x dx$):\n$\\int_0^1 x e^x dx = [x e^x]_0^1 - \\int_0^1 e^x dx = (1 \\cdot e - 0) - [e^x]_0^1 = e - (e - 1) = 1$।", "ক্যালকুলাস (যোগজীকরণ)", "BUET Admission 2020-21", "MEDIUM"),
